WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.965
AI: TASK COMPLETE.

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:06.669
23 subscriptions earlier...

00:00:06.704 --> 00:00:10.350
I clicked 'Start free trial.'

00:00:10.385 --> 00:00:15.731
DOUG. ONE TINY AUTOMATION.

00:00:15.766 --> 00:00:19.131
I asked for a second opinion.

00:00:19.166 --> 00:00:22.731
It formed a committee.

00:00:22.766 --> 00:00:26.431
Seven opinions. One credit card.

00:00:26.485 --> 00:00:30.750
Context window: the whole desert.

00:00:30.785 --> 00:00:34.833
Still forgot my name.

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:38.233
Autonomous agent.

00:00:38.268 --> 00:00:41.533
Needs Doug every 11 seconds.

00:00:41.583 --> 00:00:44.448
My AI budget is under control.

00:00:44.483 --> 00:00:47.248
I stopped opening the bill.

00:00:47.297 --> 00:00:50.562
AI: TASK COMPLETED SUCCESSFULLY.

00:00:50.597 --> 00:00:54.262
I am still UNDER the worm.

00:00:54.304 --> 00:00:55.969
SELF HOSTED.

00:00:56.004 --> 00:00:57.769
SELF FUNDED.

00:00:57.804 --> 00:00:59.858
SELF INFLICTED.

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:03.358
Local AI. Local screaming.

00:01:03.397 --> 00:01:07.862
MY FIRST APP WORKS!

00:01:07.897 --> 00:01:12.746
AI: Great. Shall I rewrite everything?

00:01:12.781 --> 00:01:17.746
It even survived a restart.

00:01:17.786 --> 00:01:21.651
LISAN AL APP.

00:01:21.707 --> 00:01:25.372
'I don't trust AI.'

00:01:25.407 --> 00:01:30.556
'Can yours fix my website?'

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:33.456
I have finally tamed the AI.

00:01:33.491 --> 00:01:37.145
AUTO-RENEW ENABLED.
